# @manual_section: parent-authoritative actor/process open remains

# Each `it` below quotes one open `- [ ]` line from the "E1 completion
# checklist" / "E2 completion checklist" sections of the plan verbatim in its
# name, so the mapping back to the plan is mechanical. All three remaining
# open checkboxes live under those two headings; every other checkbox in the
# plan is already `[x]`.
#
# Symbols referenced here are the real, already-landed public functions the
# plan's own text and its companion
# doc/03_plan/sys_test/parent_authoritative_actor_process.md name for each
# step: `parent_commit_piped_process_session_v1`
# (src/lib/nogc_async_mut/parent_commit_piped_process.spl),
# `parent_commit_owner_v1` / `commit_process_result_frames_with_candidate`
# (src/lib/nogc_async_mut/parent_commit_owner.spl),
# `parent_commit_frame_inbox_v1_for_generation`
# (src/lib/nogc_async_mut/parent_commit_inbox.spl),
# `parse_spipe_file` / `generate_feature_doc`
# (src/app/spipe_docgen/spipe_docgen/{parser,generator}.spl, re-exported from
# spipe_docgen/__init__.spl -- the plan's own "spipe-docgen" gate #3), and
# `analyze_sspec_pair_text` (src/app/sspec_maintain/analyzer.spl,
# re-exported from sspec_maintain/__init__.spl -- the plan's own
# "sspec-maintain" gate #5/#6).

